      how: [
        ['Raw data', "The agent (or the form) sends a JSON with 18 fields, uncorrected in the browser: a number may arrive as text and a field may be empty. Sex and foreign-worker status aren't even asked, because they're left out of the model."],
        ['Data transform', "The service casts the types, fills missing values with the credit-g median or mode and runs the 11 categoricals through the champion's own OneHotEncoder. A category rare in training falls into the \"infrequent\" bucket."],
        ['Normalization', "The 7 numeric variables go through the champion's StandardScaler: z = (x − mean) / sd, with the training mean and sd. That puts months and reais on the same scale."],
